#: index.php:5
msgid ""
"Collection of Liturgical events for any given year between 1970 and 9999."
msgstr "Collectio eventuum liturgicorum pro quolibet anno inter 1970 et 9999."

#. translators: 1. /calendar, 2. /calendar/nation/{NATION}, 3. /calendar/diocese/{DIOCESE}
#: index.php:8
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The base %1$s path returns liturgical events for the General Roman Calendar. "
"National and Diocesan calendars can be requested on the %2$s and %3$s paths "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"Via %1$s fundamentalis eventus liturgicos pro Calendario Generali Romano "
"reddit. Calendaria Nationalia et Diœcesana in viis %2$s et %3$s respective "
"peti possunt."

#. translators: 1. /{YEAR}
#: index.php:15
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Each of these paths can optionally be further specified with a %1$s path "
"parameter. When not specified, the API will default to the current year."
msgstr ""
"Quisque ex his itineribus potest optative ulterius specificari cum parametro "
"itineris %1$s. Cum non specificatur, API defaltum erit ad annum currentem."

#. translators: 1. /calendar/nation/{NATION}, 2. /calendar/diocese/{DIOCESE}
#: index.php:22
#, php-format
msgid ""
"These parameters are useful for tweaking the calendar results, when no "
"National or Diocesan calendar is requested. Since National and Diocesan "
"calendars have these parameters built in, the parameters are not available "
"on the %1$s and %2$s routes."
msgstr ""
"Hi parametri utiles sunt ad eventus calendarii temperandos, cum nullum "
"Calendarium Nationale vel Diœcesanum petitur. Cum Calendaria Nationalia et "
"Diœcesana hos parametros in se habeant, parametri non præsto sunt in "
"itineribus %1$s et %2$s."

#: index.php:27
msgid ""
"N.B. When none of these parameters are set, the API will use the defaults as "
"in use in the Vatican."
msgstr ""
"N.B. Cum nullus ex his parametris positus est, API utetur defaltis sicut in "
"usu in Vaticano."

#. translators: 1. /calendar
#: index.php:33
#, php-format
msgid ""
"These request parameters can always be set, whether we are requesting the "
"base %1$s resource or any resource below the %1$s path. National and "
"Diocesan calendars do not have these parameters built-in."
msgstr ""
"Hi sunt petitionis parametri semper constituendi, sive petimus basim %1$s "
"resource vel quamlibet resource infra %1$s viam. Calendaria Nationalia et "
"Diœcesana hos parametros non habent in ædificatis."

#: index.php:40
msgid ""
"It is preferable to set the locale using the Accept-Language header rather "
"than using the locale parameter. N.B. The Accept-Language header will have "
"no effect when a National or Diocesan calendar is requested."
msgstr ""
"Præstat statuere locum utendo \"Accept-Language\" intestatione potius quam "
"\"locale\" parametro. N.B. \"Accept-Language\" intestatio nullum effectum "
"habebit cum calendarium Nationalis vel Diœcesanum petitur."

#: index.php:43
msgid ""
"It is preferable to request the response content type using the Accept "
"header rather than using the return_type parameter."
msgstr ""
"Præstat petere typum contenti responsionis utendo \"Accept\" intestatione "
"potius quam \"return_type\" parametro."

#: index.php:46
msgid ""
"When not specified, the API will default to the current year. Try "
"specifically setting the year by changing the value here."
msgstr ""
"Cum non specificatum, API defaltum ad annum currentem. Conare specificare "
"annum mutando valorem hic."

