#: index.php:121 index.php:128
msgid "Liturgical Calendar Validator"
msgstr "Liturgicus Calendarii Validator"

#: index.php:127
msgid ""
"In order to verify that the liturgical data produced by the API is correct, "
"there is a Unit Test interface that can run predefined tests against the "
"JSON responses produced by the API starting from the year 1970 and going up "
"to 25 years from the current year."
msgstr ""
"Ut verificetur data liturgica ab API producta recta esse, est Interfacies "
"Unitatis Testium quæ prædefinitos testos contra responsa JSON ab API "
"producta currere potest incipiendo ab anno MCMLXX et usque ad XXV annos a "
"currenti anno."

#: index.php:132
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The unit tests are defined in the %s folder in the Liturgical Calendar API "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"Probationes unitatis in fasciculo %s in reposito API Calendarii Liturgici "
"definitæ sunt."

#: index.php:136
#, php-format
msgid "The unit test interface is curated in a repository of its own: %s."
msgstr "Interfacies unitatis testium in reposito proprio curatur: %s."

