msgstr ""
"Omnes viæ API præsto cum methodis, parametris, generibus contentorum et "
"responsionibus hic describuntur."

#. translators: card header for Easter calculation tool
#: index.php:174 usage.php:302
msgid "Calculation of the Dates of Easter"
msgstr "Calculatio Datarum Paschatis"

#: index.php:179
msgid ""
"A simple API endpoint that returns data about the Dates of Easter, both "
"Gregorian and Julian, from 1583 (year of the adoption of the Gregorian "
"Calendar) to 9999 (maximum possible date calculation in 64bit PHP), using a "
"PHP adaptation of the Meeus/Jones/Butcher algorithm for Gregorian easter "
"(observed by the Roman Catholic church) and of the Meeus algorithm for "
"Julian easter (observed by orthodox churches)."
msgstr ""
"Punctum exitus API simplex quod data de Diebus Paschæ reddit, tam "
"Gregorianis quam Iulianis, ab anno MDLXXXIII (anno adoptionis Calendarii "
"Gregoriani) usque ad MMMMMMMMMCMXCIX (maximum terminum qui in PHP 64-bit "
"computari potest), utens adaptatione PHP algorithmi Meeus/Jones/Butcher pro "
"Paschate Gregoriano (ab Ecclesia Catholica Romana observato) et algorithmi "
"Meeus pro Paschate Iuliano (ab Ecclesiis Orthodoxis observato)."

#: index.php:184
msgid "Dates of Easter API endpoint"
msgstr "Paschatis Data terminatio API"

#: index.php:186
msgid ""
"Currently the data can be requested with almost any localization. In any "
"case, since the API returns a UNIX timestamp for each date of Easter, "
"localizations can be done in a client application just as well."
msgstr ""
"Data nunc fere cum qualibet localizatione peti possunt. Utcumque sit, cum "
"API notationem temporis UNIX pro singulis diebus Paschæ reddat, "
"localizationes in applicatione clientis æque commode fieri possunt."

